{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"e3834c28d603d6d837b15af63533502f7d7e4cae9ba82124a5a0bcaacf4c4de1","slug":"programming.intro","location":"/programming/intro.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"简介","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/programming/intro.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/programming/intro.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"intro.md","url":"/seismology101/build/intro-68be5ba3795e3fed56c8de60ed157cfd.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 姚家园、田冬冬","key":"tj63HytE1O"}],"key":"IbrIgzQLj1"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2022-03-12","key":"V66yDVCNBK"}],"key":"ZQuKp0CDpZ"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"⏱️ 5 分钟","key":"qT3dDsbPEq"}],"key":"AjSPZV3NUN"}],"key":"WTQwQLoTpy"}],"key":"BKQGO8q7Gh"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"yPTWGHBYll"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为什么要学编程？","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"ncVutWd7hE"}],"identifier":"id","label":"为什么要学编程？","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"lutjpLpKNP"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"几乎所有高校在大一都开设了类似《C 语言程序设计》这门课，想必你对 C 语言以及\n编程都已经有了一些了解。编程本质上就是人将某个问题的解决思路写成\n计算机能够读懂的指令，计算机则执行指令帮助人解决问题。","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"zGiMwcVROo"}],"key":"vNKT8Ubao7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震学是一门基于观测数据的科学。地震学科研中需要对大量观测数据进行处理和分析，\n并作一些理论计算，因而需要通过编程让计算机辅助完成数据处理或科学计算。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"uJDIAsCdR8"}],"key":"cj0YIOr0Ca"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"编程语言有哪些？","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"d4n12Rcs17"}],"identifier":"id","label":"编程语言有哪些？","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"PayatIlzMu"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"世界上存在的编程语言有几百个，其中用的比较多的大概有十几个。\n编程语言根据执行方式的差异大致可以分为两大类：","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"cqh9bKnJqE"}],"key":"oqIjTPURli"},{"type":"definitionList","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"definitionTerm","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"编译型语言","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"wwqW0jmwmI"}],"key":"aH1v106MSz"},{"type":"definitionDescription","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"编译型语言是指需要使用特定的","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"YRuBokPssv"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"编译器","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"yiFADgM8nP"}],"key":"I9fFOgQehJ"},{"type":"text","value":"将源代码编译成在当前系统上可执行的\n二进制文件，再通过运行该二进制文件以执行代码。\nC、C++、Fortran 和 Java 等是常见的编译型语言。","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"F0DzKPE6lc"}],"key":"vaOStT2vTv"}],"key":"WJbXtwqTNi"},{"type":"definitionTerm","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"解释型语言","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"Ir1kq1OJNO"}],"key":"r4om2AIniQ"},{"type":"definitionDescription","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"解释型语言是指需要使用特定的","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"ZgcnpgbIdI"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"解释器","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"cTbqx6wK9L"}],"key":"OGaXBo1N7c"},{"type":"text","value":"读取源代码并立即执行代码。\nPython 和 Matlab 等是常见的解释型语言。","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"nAgo5dBjcf"}],"key":"U6o5kpayd7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一般将解释型语言编写的源代码称为脚本（script），所以解释型语言也称为","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"irhff2Hdcb"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"脚本语言","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"sREA4WgpZo"}],"key":"OSgEPcAgFA"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n实际上，脚本就是包含一系列指令的文本文件。解释器读取这个文件，\n立即依次执行脚本里的所有命令、函数以及表达式等。","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"nKlj1N5OkH"}],"key":"GB8RyOAPPp"}],"key":"rctamOQksr"}],"key":"gyLt2T3Gjv"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"两种语言都有各自的优缺点。一般而言，编译型语言编写的代码运行速度更快，但需要\n花费更多的时间编写代码，还需要先编译才能使用，因而需要掌握编译方法。解释型语言\n更易于编写，开源的软件库和模块更多，不需要编译即可执行，但一般代码执行速度慢。","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"fHaRUxe0LJ"}],"key":"kdE1sMs1kf"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"我该学习那种编程语言？","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"V3PAOIF3mE"}],"identifier":"id","label":"我该学习那种编程语言？","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"ZAfkUOHixY"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震学科研工作者需至少掌握一门脚本语言，同时推荐学习一门编译型语言","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"rFLBHF184p"}],"key":"k9Pn6iAa3m"},{"type":"text","value":"。对于脚本语言，\n推荐使用目前在地震学领域最流行的 Python 语言，其官方模块、第三方模块和软件包众多，\n基本可以满足日常科研工作需求。而使用哪种编译型语言并不重要，熟悉掌握一门编译型语言，\n其他编译型语言也就可以很快地学会和上手了。","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"ahBoTPrFL0"}],"key":"bbRI80QpUx"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"日常的数据处理和简单的科学计算可以使用脚本语言快速实现，以便迅速上手和开展研究。如果需要\n更高的计算效率，可以使用编译型语言编写代码。因此，完成一个项目往往是同时使用这两类编程语言\n来编写代码。有时候还可以用脚本语言快速、便捷地实现一个任务的一部分，然后调用使用编译型语言\n书写的需求计算效率的另外一部分的代码来加速计算。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1},"end":{"line":50,"column":1}},"key":"Tv4CSQCeGF"}],"key":"VmbK6mBtay"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"需要注意的是，在本教程中我们将 Linux 和 macOS 系统的 Shell 也归为脚本语言。严格说来，\nShell 其实本身只是一个空壳，具有最基本的条件判断和循环功能。借助 Linux 和 macOS 系统的\n命令行工具，如 ","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"am1lexA7IC"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"awk","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"oTcRXtwpTs"},{"type":"text","value":"、","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"nFSmZf6TMX"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sort","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"fOJs370UGF"},{"type":"text","value":"、","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"RPFmg6H9nm"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"grep","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"A6EnLQ1veQ"},{"type":"text","value":"，其可以用来做日常的数据处理、\n字符串处理等。Shell 脚本一般仅适合用几行就可以搞定的简单程序，更复杂的情况建议使用其他\n脚本语言来完成。我们以一种常见的 Shell 来讲述其基本语法和用途，即 Bash，其他常见的 Shell\n还有 Zsh、csh 等。","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"HT24B71UB3"}],"key":"ycr6Ly23hr"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"日常编程除了直接编写代码，往往还需要写 README 文件和记一些笔记，有时还要写代码的参考文档。\n因此，推荐学习一种标记语言以便更简洁、更高效地完成上述事务。推荐学习 Markdown 标记语言。","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"key":"xhb1RiHliY"}],"key":"Ikbr44G16Y"}],"key":"H0gWw1A4pA"}],"key":"fwcTHDkYPi"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Linux 常用命令","url":"/computer/commands","group":"计算机基础"},"next":{"title":"编程语言","url":"/programming/languages","group":"编程基础"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}